<p> </p></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-51_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-52_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-53_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-55_"><strong>Note:</strong></span></p></div></div></div><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-dPZUdm cBqcmb pf-56_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-eBHgEO eUYsjc pf-57_ pf-text-1">Venustas chargers and charger cable are specially equipped to charge <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/collections/battery-charger" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas batteries</span></a></strong>, ensuring a complete match and excellent charging performance. Venustas batteries are intricately designed to integrate with Venustas heated apparel to ensure safety and heating efficiency.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-eBHgEO eUYsjc pf-59_ pf-text-1">Please don’t use non-original plugs, charging cables, and batteries in case of any potential risks, such as product damage, fire, explosion, or other hazardous incidents. Any issue caused by the non-original accessories cannot be covered under the warranty.<br><br>  </li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-eBHgEO eUYsjc pf-61_ pf-text-1">As part of our efforts to reach our environmental goal, our 12V heated clothing does not include the charger. Our batteries are compatible with all kinds of power adapter or third-party adapter that comply with applicable safety cables. </li></ul><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-63_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-65_"><strong><br>Learn More:</strong>
<br><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/battery-guide-5v-7-4v-12v-which-one-is-better" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Battery Guide: 5V, 7.4V, 12V, Which One Is Better?</span></a></strong>
<br><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/product-comparison-what-s-the-best-battery-for-the-heated-jacket" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">What’s The Best Battery For The Heated Jacket?</span></a></strong>
<br><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/which-battery-capacity-is-larger-10000mah-14400mah-or-16800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Which Battery Capacity Is Larger: 10000mAh, 14400mAh, Or 16800mAh?</span></a></strong><br> </span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-9992" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-66_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-67_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-68_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-69_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-71_"><strong>Step 2：Check if the charger and cable are functioning properly.</strong></span></h3><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/1_12160bfc-42e5-4f6d-8c3d-ba9530bef54c.gif?v=1715764248" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/1_12160bfc-42e5-4f6d-8c3d-ba9530bef54c.gif?v=1715764248 1536w" width="384" height="216" alt="Check the charger and cable functionality" title="Check the charger and cable functionality" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-sLtfs jkHPMQ pf-72_ pf-image-1"/><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-73_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-74_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-75_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-77_">1. Please carefully inspect both the charger and cable for any visible signs of damage, such as cracks or deformities. *Avoid using any damaged accessories.<br><br>2. Safely insert the cable into the charger port, and then plug the entire charger into a power outlet. Make sure the connection between the cable, charger, and power outlet is secure and stable.<br><br>3. Check if the cable and charger are functioning properly by charging your heated apparel or mobile devices. If you encounter any issues or the charger fails to operate as expected, reach out to our <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">customer service team</span></a></strong> for further assistance.<br> </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-9b3e" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-78_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-79_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-80_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-81_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-83_"><strong>
Step 3: Inspect and test the battery.</strong></span></h3><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-84_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-85_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-86_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-88_">1.&nbsp;Inspect the appearance of the battery for any noticeable damage, such as swelling, cracks, or loose ports. To ensure safety, please don’t use a damaged battery.<br> </span></p><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-89_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-91_">2. Press the power button to check the battery level.&nbsp;For <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-6000 batteries</span></a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_self"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-7500 batteries</span></a></strong>, and <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_self"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-10000 batteries</span></a></strong>, the battery indicator represents the battery level. The number of illuminated indicator lights corresponds to different battery levels.<br><br> </span></p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Step_3_Inspect_and_test_the_battery_2_ae7b8fb8-43d1-4668-9567-cc02c1548c60.gif?v=1715849605" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Step_3_Inspect_and_test_the_battery_2_ae7b8fb8-43d1-4668-9567-cc02c1548c60.gif?v=1715849605 1536w" width="384" height="216" alt="Step 3 Inspect and test the battery(2).gif__PID:b95fc5a1-8d16-4be0-8ce0-8ba4fc953d97" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-sLtfs jkHPMQ pf-99_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div><p class="sc-kAkozD iOjmJ pf-100_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">3. If none of the indicator lights, it may indicate the battery is out of power and needs charging. After fully charging, unplug the battery from the cable and press the battery button to verify the power level.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-102_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-103_"><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-brPMkR emByB pf-104_"><style>
