</div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-105_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-106_"><p class="sc-kAkozD iOjmJ pf-107_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Note:</strong><br></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-dPZUdm cBqcmb pf-109_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-eBHgEO eUYsjc pf-110_ pf-text-1"><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-6000&nbsp;batteries</span></a></strong> require a 5V/3A charger for fast charging, fully charged only in 4 hours. Additionally, a 20V/1.75A charger for charging <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"></a><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-7500 batteries&nbsp;</span></a></strong>and <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-10000 batteries </span></a></strong>can achieve a quick charge within 2 or 3 hours.</li></ul><p class="sc-kAkozD iOjmJ pf-112_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">4. Verify if the battery powers both the heated apparel and mobile phone properly. If it charge neither, the battery may be faulty. If it only can charge the mobile phone, there maybe something wrong with the apparel; If it charges both but the heated apparel cannot heat, there might be an issue with the apparel. Contact our <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></a><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">customer service team</span></a> </strong>for further assistance.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ee6d" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-114_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-115_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-116_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-117_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-119_"><strong>Step 4: Check if the heated apparel can activate preheating.</strong></span></h3><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-120_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-121_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-122_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-124_">1.&nbsp;Make sure your battery has sufficient remaining power, then connect it to the connecting wire inside the inner battery pocket of the heated apparel.<br><br>2. Press and hold the power button on the apparel for 3-5 seconds until the red LED lights up. It indicates the apparel begins to preheat for 5 minutes and then it automatically adjusts to medium heat (indicated by a white LED).<br><strong><br>Note:<br></strong><font color="#000000"><b><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/heated-gloves-for-men-women-7-4v-2-0" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas heated gloves 2.0&nbsp;</span></a></strong></b></font>and <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/heated-socks-for-men-and-women-7-4v" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">heated socks </span></a></strong>do not feature the preheating function. Simply press the power button for 3-5 seconds until the red LED lights up to start at a high level.<br><br>3.&nbsp;Move to the next step if your apparel can successfully activate preheating. If not, please try another Venustas battery (if you have one) and repeat the above steps. If it still cannot work, please contact our<strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"> customer service team</span></a></strong> for further assistance. <br> </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-125_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-126_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/3.gif?v=1715765439" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/3.gif?v=1715765439 1536w" width="384" height="216" alt="3.gif__PID:1635ab28-1bc2-494f-9461-8d4ae18b5eac" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-sLtfs jkHPMQ pf-127_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-9bfe" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-128_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-129_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-130_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-131_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-133_"><strong>Step 5: Check if the power button can cycle through different heating levels.
</strong></span></h3><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-134_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-135_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-136_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-138_">After preheating, shortly press the power button to adjust the heating levels, inspecting if it can cycle through high level, medium level, and low level. If you can smoothly switch between 3 heating levels, please move to step 6. If not, please contact our <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">customer service team</span></a></strong>&nbsp;for further assistance.<br><strong><br></strong><strong>Note:</strong><br> </span></p></div></div></div><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-dPZUdm cBqcmb pf-139_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-eBHgEO eUYsjc pf-140_ pf-text-1"><strong><a href="/products/heated-socks-for-men-and-women-7-4v" target="_self"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas heated socks</span></a></strong> will automatically switch to medium heat after remaining at the high level for 15 minutes.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-142_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-143_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Check_if_the_power_button_can_cycle_through_different_heating_levels_898baa86-a8bb-48e7-8b7a-d51d45c7fcbb.gif?v=1715843860" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Check_if_the_power_button_can_cycle_through_different_heating_levels_898baa86-a8bb-48e7-8b7a-d51d45c7fcbb.gif?v=1715843860 1536w" width="384" height="216" alt="Check if the power button can cycle through different heating levels.gif__PID:19992646-71bd-41e5-80ac-eb5d4f6aea38" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-sLtfs jkHPMQ pf-144_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-7085" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-145_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-146_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-147_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-148_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-150_"><strong>Step 6: Check if heated apparel can generate obvious heat.
</strong></span></h3><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-151_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-152_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-153_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-155_">To test the level of the warmth, please adjust the apparel at the high level and then zip it up. After 3-5 minutes, touch the heating zones on the inner lining to feel the warmth. In normal conditions, the temperature of the high level is 131℉/55℃, so you can feel the obvious heat. If you cannot feel any warmth, please contact our <strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">customer service team</span></a></strong>&nbsp;for further assistance.<br> </span></p><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-brPMkR emByB pf-156_"><p data-mce-fragment="1">Note:</p>
<ul data-mce-fragment="1">
  <li data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1"></span>For a more accurate assessment, conduct this test
    indoors. Exposure to lower temperatures or unzipping the apparel could affect the experience.</li>
</ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-157_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-158_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Check_if_heated_apparel_can_generate_obvious_heat.gif?v=1715766635" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Check_if_heated_apparel_can_generate_obvious_heat.gif?v=1715766635 1536w" width="384" height="216" alt="Check if heated apparel can generate obvious heat.gif__PID:54a8e2fc-ac12-4ca8-ab79-81edcfb25cdd" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-sLtfs jkHPMQ pf-159_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-160_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-161_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-162_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-164_"><strong>Learn More:</strong>
<br><u><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/how-to-use-venustas-heated-jacket" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">How to Use Heated Jacket?</span></a></strong></u><br><u><strong><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/how-to-wash-venustas-heated-jacket" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">How to Wash Heated Jacket?</span></a></strong></u></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-21c2" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-165_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-166_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-167_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-168_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-169_"><p class="sc-lnPyOc exfzrW pf-170_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fThTNe cAYhcc pf-172_">If you're still encountering difficulties with your product after troubleshooting, please feel free to reach out to our friendly<a href="https://venustasofficial.com/pages/contact-us" target="_blank"><strong><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"> customer service team</span></strong></a>&nbsp;for further assistance. We're here to provide you with all the help and support you need to ensure your satisfaction.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-eb95" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-YysaK kYyPCk pf-173_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ktPOXr dplAGv"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-174_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bDoQz cmNGeH pf-